      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2013 Elsevier Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "The optimization of oxazole-based PDE4 inhibitor 1 has led to the identification of both oral (compound 16) and inhaled (compound 34) PDE4 inhibitors. Selectivity against PDE10/PDE11, off target screening, and in vivo activity in the rat are discussed."
